---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How to Buy a Kitten — Worldwide Delivery | JinLin Cattery" description="A clear, step-by-step guide to reserving and receiving a kitten from JinLin — from WhatsApp enquiry to door-to-door delivery worldwide, including health checks and customs clearance.">
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:64px;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow" data-en="How it works" data-zh="购买流程">How it works</div>
      <h1 style="font-size:44px;margin-bottom:16px;" data-en="From enquiry to your home — a clear, five-step journey" data-zh="从咨询到到家——清晰的五步流程">From enquiry to your home — a clear, five-step journey</h1>
      <p class="section-sub" style="max-width:720px;" data-en="Buying a kitten internationally can feel complex. We handle the entire journey — health checks, veterinary certificates, import permits and customs clearance — so you can simply welcome your companion home." data-zh="跨境购买猫咪可能看似复杂。我们全程代办——健康检查、兽医证书、进口许可与清关——您只需迎接新伙伴回家。">Buying a kitten internationally can feel complex. We handle the entire journey — health checks, veterinary certificates, import permits and customs clearance — so you can simply welcome your companion home.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title" data-en="The five steps" data-zh="五个步骤">The five steps</h2>
      <div class="steps" style="margin-bottom:64px;">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">01</div>
          <h3 data-en="Enquiry" data-zh="咨询">Enquiry</h3>
          <p data-en="Message us on WhatsApp with the breed, colour and timing you have in mind." data-zh="通过 WhatsApp 告诉我们您想要的品种、颜色与时间。">Message us on WhatsApp with the breed, colour and timing you have in mind.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">02</div>
          <h3 data-en="Virtual viewing" data-zh="线上看猫">Virtual viewing</h3>
          <p data-en="We arrange a video viewing of your kitten and their parents, sharing health records." data-zh="我们安排视频看猫，展示小猫及其父母，并共享健康档案。">We arrange a video viewing of your kitten and their parents, sharing health records.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">03</div>
          <h3 data-en="Reservation" data-zh="预订">Reservation</h3>
          <p data-en="A reservation secures your kitten while we complete health checks and travel paperwork." data-zh="预订锁定您的小猫，同时我们完成健康检查与运输文件。">A reservation secures your kitten while we complete health checks and travel paperwork.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">04</div>
          <h3 data-en="Health & paperwork" data-zh="健康与文件">Health & paperwork</h3>
          <p data-en="Vaccinations, veterinary certificates, import permits and customs clearance are all completed for you." data-zh="疫苗接种、兽医证书、进口许可与清关全部为您代办。">Vaccinations, veterinary certificates, import permits and customs clearance are all completed for you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">05</div>
          <h3 data-en="Welcome home" data-zh="到家">Welcome home</h3>
          <p data-en="Your kitten arrives at your home with a complete records pack." data-zh="您的小猫带着完整档案包抵达您的家。">Your kitten arrives at your home with a complete records pack.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title" data-en="What we handle for you" data-zh="我们为您代办的事项">What we handle for you</h2>
      <p class="section-sub" data-en="International delivery involves several steps. We manage every one of them." data-zh="国际配送涉及多个环节，我们全部为您代办。">International delivery involves several steps. We manage every one of them.</p>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="icon">✓</div>
          <h3 data-en="Vaccinations & health checks" data-zh="疫苗与健康检查">Vaccinations & health checks</h3>
          <p data-en="Age-appropriate vaccinations and a full veterinary assessment before travel." data-zh="运输前完成适龄疫苗接种与完整兽医评估。">Age-appropriate vaccinations and a full veterinary assessment before travel.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="icon">✈</div>
          <h3 data-en="Veterinary certificates" data-zh="兽医证书">Veterinary certificates</h3>
          <p data-en="Export health certificates issued in line with your destination country's import requirements." data-zh="按您目的国的进口要求签发出口健康证书。">Export health certificates issued in line with your destination country's import requirements.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="icon">§</div>
          <h3 data-en="Import permits" data-zh="进口许可">Import permits</h3>
          <p data-en="We arrange the required import permits before your kitten travels." data-zh="猫咪启程前，我们办好所需进口许可。">We arrange the required import permits before your kitten travels.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="icon">✪</div>
          <h3 data-en="Customs clearance" data-zh="清关">Customs clearance</h3>
          <p data-en="Full customs clearance on arrival, so there's nothing for you to manage." data-zh="抵达时全程清关，您无需操心任何手续。">Full customs clearance on arrival, so there's nothing for you to manage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="icon">♡</div>
          <h3 data-en="Door-to-door delivery" data-zh="门到门配送">Door-to-door delivery</h3>
          <p data-en="Your kitten is delivered safely to your home — worldwide, with specialist routes into Dubai, Abu Dhabi and across the UAE." data-zh="猫咪安全送达您的家——全球可达，迪拜、阿布扎比及阿联酋全境专线优先。">Your kitten is delivered safely to your home — worldwide, with specialist routes into Dubai, Abu Dhabi and across the UAE.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="icon">∞</div>
          <h3 data-en="Records pack & support" data-zh="档案包与支持">Records pack & support</h3>
          <p data-en="Complete health documentation, plus lifetime support after arrival." data-zh="完整健康文件，外加抵达后的终身支持。">Complete health documentation, plus lifetime support after arrival.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-band">
        <h2 data-en="Ready to find your kitten?" data-zh="准备好寻找您的猫咪了吗？">Ready to find your kitten?</h2>
        <p data-en="Tell us what you're looking for and we'll guide you through the process." data-zh="告诉我们您的需求，我们引导您走完整个流程。">Tell us what you're looking for and we'll guide you through the process.</p>
        <a href="https://wa.me/8613617603072?text=Hello%2C%20I%27m%20looking%20for%20a%20kitten" class="btn btn-wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-en="Chat on WhatsApp" data-zh="WhatsApp 在线咨询">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
